WEBVTT

00:00:03.979 --> 00:00:06.816
Mom! Come with me!

00:00:06.816 --> 00:00:09.360
What’s the matter, Leopard?

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.445
This way!

00:00:14.156 --> 00:00:16.325
It’s you and me, Mom!

00:00:17.868 --> 00:00:20.371
Wow, they look exactly like us.

00:00:26.961 --> 00:00:31.048
Your hands are cold like ice.

00:00:34.301 --> 00:00:36.554
It feels warm!

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.960
Absent-minded, I only prayed to the stars

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:04.760
Losing sight of all that was precious

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:09.600
Absent-minded, I kept my eyes fixed on the same spot

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:15.310
And came to a standstill myself

00:01:17.230 --> 00:01:20.480
We don't need no reasons

00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:25.570
To change for the better

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:32.870
Now, let's dream to the extreme

00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:34.960
You're a shooting star

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:38.250
Kick open the doors that stand in your way

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:43.470
And leap beyond the infinite horizon

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:45.550
Light on the shooting star

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:51.560
Don't look back; what you seek is in front of you

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:54.680
Let's go in search of it

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:59.440
Fly away

00:02:15.436 --> 00:02:19.273
A bear! A mantis! And, a dinosaur, maybe?

00:02:19.273 --> 00:02:21.358
There are a lot of them!

00:02:21.358 --> 00:02:24.695
Doronjo, if you run fast like that…

00:02:24.695 --> 00:02:26.906
Ally! Doronjo!

00:02:28.073 --> 00:02:30.075
Whoa! I can’t see your face!

00:02:31.035 --> 00:02:32.703
Are you okay?

00:02:38.083 --> 00:02:39.835
An angel…

00:02:39.835 --> 00:02:42.755
Don’t touch the statues, okay?!

00:02:42.755 --> 00:02:46.050
They are holy statues of
Lord and Lady Yatterman!

00:02:51.055 --> 00:02:52.556
Damn Yatterman!

00:02:52.556 --> 00:02:54.225
Don’t say that when the soldiers are around.

00:02:54.225 --> 00:02:55.726
Hey, where’s Honorable Oda?

00:02:55.726 --> 00:02:58.562
Oh no! There are so many
soldiers around, too…

00:02:58.562 --> 00:03:00.105
Did he get kidnapped?!

00:03:00.105 --> 00:03:02.900
He might be hiding somewhere around here.

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:05.152
Honorable Oda?!

00:03:05.152 --> 00:03:08.072
You can’t do that! Of all things,
you peed on the Yatterman statues!

00:03:08.072 --> 00:03:09.823
What?!

00:03:09.823 --> 00:03:12.368
Whoa! What’s with you guys?!

00:03:12.368 --> 00:03:14.411
What’s with us?! Are you nuts?!

00:03:14.411 --> 00:03:16.914
Could it be that you wanna see my stuff?!

00:03:16.914 --> 00:03:18.749
Soldiers might see you!

00:03:18.749 --> 00:03:20.751
Hey What’re you doing?!

00:03:20.751 --> 00:03:23.837
Hm? Oh, it was just some snowmen.

00:03:28.634 --> 00:03:32.471
You’d better thank me. If it
wasn’t for my snowman skills…

00:03:32.471 --> 00:03:35.140
I'm Takeshi. Uhm, what time is it now?

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:38.269
They shoot without any hesitation!

00:03:39.603 --> 00:03:41.939
Hey, form a single line.

00:03:41.939 --> 00:03:43.649
What’re they doing in a place like this?

00:03:43.649 --> 00:03:47.403
A martial arts tournament
will be held tomorrow.

00:03:47.403 --> 00:03:49.280
I’ll kick some ass!

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:52.658
If you win, you’'ll get a sheep
and some pocket money.

00:03:52.658 --> 00:03:54.451
A sheep and some pocket money?

00:03:54.451 --> 00:03:57.871
That’s quite extravagant for Yatter Kingdom.

00:03:57.871 --> 00:03:59.290
Sumo…

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:00.708
boxing…

00:04:00.708 --> 00:04:03.961
and pro-wrestling tournaments
will be held at the same time.

00:04:03.961 --> 00:04:05.796
Sumo is that thing, right?

00:04:05.796 --> 00:04:09.008
The one where two naked guys tussle?

00:04:09.008 --> 00:04:10.050
Yeah, I think so…

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:14.471
Boxing is the one where two
naked guy hit each other.

00:04:14.471 --> 00:04:15.347
So, what’s pro-wrestling like?

00:04:15.347 --> 00:04:16.432
Beats me.

00:04:16.432 --> 00:04:19.685
It’s a tussle between two naked guys!

00:04:19.685 --> 00:04:21.812
So, how’s that different from Sumo?

00:04:21.812 --> 00:04:23.731
Ah! It’s a most my turn!

00:04:23.731 --> 00:04:26.400
Let’s enter Tonzra in one of them!

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:29.778
Good idea, since we have no money.

00:04:29.778 --> 00:04:30.571
How old are you?

00:04:30.571 --> 00:04:31.488
I'm fifteen!

00:04:31.488 --> 00:04:33.032
Okay, so you’re a minor.

00:04:33.032 --> 00:04:34.825
Yes! My name is Takeshi.

00:04:34.825 --> 00:04:38.162
--In the sumo tournament, one of us…
--…will probably win.

00:04:38.162 --> 00:04:39.663
Oh, then, he’s gonna win?

00:04:39.663 --> 00:04:42.207
Only minors can participate in the tournament!

00:04:42.207 --> 00:04:43.083
What?

00:04:43.083 --> 00:04:44.877
Wh-What’re we gonna do?

00:04:44.877 --> 00:04:47.046
No matter how you look at Tonzra, he’s…

00:04:47.046 --> 00:04:50.841
I’m a minor! What do yo think?

00:04:50.841 --> 00:04:52.551
He definitely doesn’t look like a minor!

00:04:52.551 --> 00:04:54.011
You enter, Gatchan!

00:04:54.011 --> 00:04:55.846
Hey, there’s no way I can win!

00:04:55.846 --> 00:04:57.973
Don’t give up before you try!

00:04:57.973 --> 00:05:00.267
H-Hey, wait!

00:05:00.267 --> 00:05:02.311
I’ll use a die to decide.

00:05:02.311 --> 00:05:05.773
Galina, was it? I went ahead and entered you.

00:05:05.773 --> 00:05:07.524
What?!

00:05:07.524 --> 00:05:12.029
Let’s fight fair and square!
I’m Takeshi! Later!

00:05:12.029 --> 00:05:15.532
Ladies and gentlemen!
Please watch this carefully!

00:05:15.532 --> 00:05:18.702
This is a very rare snow rabbit
that actually moves!

00:05:18.702 --> 00:05:21.038
--Hm? What’s that?
--It’s just ordinary snow.

00:05:21.038 --> 00:05:22.247
Does it really move?

00:05:22.247 --> 00:05:25.709
Now, little snow rabbit, jump!

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:30.672
Hey, please let me see it, too.

00:05:30.672 --> 00:05:32.174
Wow!

00:05:32.174 --> 00:05:35.094
This is amazing!
The rabbit is jumping around!

00:05:35.094 --> 00:05:38.305
--Right? It’s amazing, isn’t it?
--Please let me take a closer look!

00:05:38.305 --> 00:05:42.393
To come up with something like this…
You really are a genius, Boyayan!

00:05:42.393 --> 00:05:46.522
We have to survive the
tough era we live in, so…

00:05:46.522 --> 00:05:49.650
Now, if you buy this snow rabbit
right now, it’ll only cost you ten yen!

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:53.362
You don’t have to pay any sales tax!
Why don’t you buy one?!

00:05:53.362 --> 00:05:56.990
--But it looks like it’ll melt soon.
--Ten yen is too much for that.

00:05:56.990 --> 00:05:59.410
It’d be better to buy a kernel of corn.

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:01.495
I have no money.

00:06:01.495 --> 00:06:04.081
O-Oh, you guys don’t want it?

00:06:04.081 --> 00:06:05.416
l see…

00:06:05.416 --> 00:06:06.959
Let me buy one, please!

00:06:06.959 --> 00:06:07.918
What?!

00:06:07.918 --> 00:06:11.839
Here’s the money…
though this is all I have.

00:06:11.839 --> 00:06:15.175
Oh, sure, thank you very much!

00:06:15.175 --> 00:06:16.635
It's over!

00:06:16.635 --> 00:06:17.761
It’s not over yet!

00:06:17.761 --> 00:06:19.555
All right!

00:06:19.555 --> 00:06:24.143
I’ll… I’ll use this to cheer up my mom!

00:06:24.143 --> 00:06:25.477
What?

00:06:25.477 --> 00:06:29.982
My mom is sick in bed all the time
and can’t enjoy the snow festival.

00:06:29.982 --> 00:06:31.650
So I can at least use this!

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:33.944
Thank you very much!

00:06:38.323 --> 00:06:40.617
Please wait!

00:06:40.617 --> 00:06:46.123
To tell you the truth, we were moving
that snow rabbit using this magnet.

00:06:46.123 --> 00:06:49.251
Magnet? So this won’t work by itself?

00:06:49.251 --> 00:06:53.297
We normally sell the magnet separately,
but we’ll give you a special deal today!

00:06:53.297 --> 00:06:57.551
You can have this magnet free.
Cheer up your mom with these!

00:06:57.551 --> 00:07:02.681
Oh, the snow rabbit is free, too!
Here, I’ll give you the ten yen back!

00:07:02.681 --> 00:07:04.433
Watch out!

00:07:05.851 --> 00:07:07.728
That was close.

00:07:07.728 --> 00:07:08.812
Whoa…

00:07:08.812 --> 00:07:10.856
He’s strong.

00:07:13.484 --> 00:07:15.944
Please cheer up your mom.

00:07:15.944 --> 00:07:18.447
We’ll be praying for her quick recovery.

00:07:18.447 --> 00:07:19.907
Thanks!

00:07:21.074 --> 00:07:23.785
He cares about his mom
so much. What a good kid.

00:07:23.785 --> 00:07:25.829
Yeah, he’s such a devoted son.

00:07:25.829 --> 00:07:27.873
Thank you very much!

00:07:27.873 --> 00:07:31.001
You failed in business, though.

00:07:31.001 --> 00:07:34.379
I'm supposed to fight him?

00:07:37.174 --> 00:07:38.842
l can’t do it!

00:07:38.842 --> 00:07:41.220
Just do it, Gatchan!

00:07:41.220 --> 00:07:43.931
--Mongolian mutton barbeque!
--Alouette is watching!

00:07:43.931 --> 00:07:46.642
-- Mongolian mutton barbeque!
--Now, bring it on!

00:07:46.642 --> 00:07:48.602
-- Mr. Sheep
--A though I'm scared…

00:07:48.602 --> 00:07:50.854
I have no choice but to do it!

00:07:55.192 --> 00:07:55.776
You’re weak!

00:07:55.776 --> 00:07:59.112
You think you can be a Yokozuna like that?

00:07:59.112 --> 00:08:00.447
Yokozuna?

00:08:00.447 --> 00:08:02.908
That’s the title for the
strongest Sumo wrestler.

00:08:02.908 --> 00:08:05.869
I don’t have to be a Yokozuna!

00:08:06.870 --> 00:08:08.413
That?!

00:08:08.413 --> 00:08:10.874
So, you wanted to be a Yokozuna, Galina?

00:08:10.874 --> 00:08:12.376
What’re you saying?! No way!

00:08:12.376 --> 00:08:15.045
I-It got stuck!

00:08:16.046 --> 00:08:18.674
Ready… start!

00:08:20.884 --> 00:08:24.054
There! Grab and roll her!

00:08:24.054 --> 00:08:25.681
l did it!

00:08:25.681 --> 00:08:27.808
No! That doesn’t count!

00:08:27.808 --> 00:08:29.935
One more time!

00:08:34.565 --> 00:08:36.358
l-l may be starting to
have some confidence…

00:08:36.358 --> 00:08:39.236
You’re pushing down a small girl!
Don’t be so pleased!

00:08:39.236 --> 00:08:41.947
You’re not done yet.

00:08:41.947 --> 00:08:43.949
Once you have confidence,
move onto the next step.

00:08:43.949 --> 00:08:45.659
I need to do something more?

00:08:45.659 --> 00:08:47.119
It’s my turn.

00:08:47.119 --> 00:08:49.246
--Not yet!
--Not yet?!

00:08:50.163 --> 00:08:52.291
Ready… start!

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:57.629
I'm not good at sports, you know…

00:08:57.629 --> 00:08:59.381
Let’s stop now!

00:08:59.381 --> 00:09:03.385
Oh, you lost our confidence…
Then, one more time.

00:09:03.385 --> 00:09:05.470
What?! Me again?

00:09:05.470 --> 00:09:06.346
Ah!

00:09:06.346 --> 00:09:07.347
Ahhhh!

00:09:07.347 --> 00:09:08.557
Wh-What?!

00:09:08.557 --> 00:09:12.477
I need to pee!

00:09:12.477 --> 00:09:14.271
What the heck?!

00:09:16.523 --> 00:09:20.444
This is General Goro's machine
Make sure you don’t scratch it.

00:09:24.781 --> 00:09:28.994
General Goro, Yatterpug is undergoing
maintenance without a hitch.

00:09:28.994 --> 00:09:30.954
How’s the town?

00:09:30.954 --> 00:09:34.708
Yes, sir! I heard that the snow festival
is having quite the turnout.

00:09:34.708 --> 00:09:37.169
Let them enjoy it moderately.

00:09:37.169 --> 00:09:42.299
We need to have them let off a bit of steam,
or those idiots could start a rebellion again.

00:09:42.299 --> 00:09:43.925
Yes, sir! Yatterman!

00:09:43.925 --> 00:09:45.385
Yatterman!

00:09:45.385 --> 00:09:48.805
Okay, keep coming! Stop!

00:09:48.805 --> 00:09:54.770
Even if more rebels appear,
I will execute them…

00:09:54.770 --> 00:09:58.357
…just like the girl who called
herself Doronjo and her gang.

00:10:01.401 --> 00:10:05.947
I’ll show no mercy to the fools
who go against Yatterman.

00:10:11.161 --> 00:10:13.622
I did it too hard…

00:10:15.832 --> 00:10:18.752
Use your knees! Keep your body low!

00:10:18.752 --> 00:10:20.671
If I use the skillet for
Mongolian mutton barbeque,

00:10:20.671 --> 00:10:24.299
I may be able to build an interesting mecha.

00:10:24.299 --> 00:10:27.010
Gatchan’s training hard.

00:10:28.512 --> 00:10:30.972
Hey, what’re you doing?

00:10:30.972 --> 00:10:32.391
Done!

00:10:33.475 --> 00:10:36.812
It’s you and me!

00:10:50.575 --> 00:10:54.079
Your hands are cold like me, Alouette.

00:10:54.079 --> 00:10:57.040
Yeah, it was cold!

00:10:59.918 --> 00:11:01.878
It feels warm!

00:11:02.713 --> 00:11:05.632
I’ll do this, and I’ll do that, and…

00:11:27.571 --> 00:11:29.114
Gatchan!

00:11:29.114 --> 00:11:30.073
When’s Gatchan’s turn?

00:11:30.073 --> 00:11:31.408
Is it his turn yet?

00:11:31.408 --> 00:11:33.076
He’s coming up soon.

00:11:33.076 --> 00:11:34.828
Tyzon is the winner!

00:11:37.330 --> 00:11:39.416
Hanzen is the winner!

00:11:39.416 --> 00:11:43.253
The next match in Sumo
is Galina versus Musashn!

00:11:44.629 --> 00:11:45.755
It’s cold…

00:11:45.755 --> 00:11:48.133
--I'm scared…
--For you to come out to a place like this…

00:11:48.133 --> 00:11:51.511
Are you just goofing around?!

00:11:52.679 --> 00:11:54.306
Now!

00:11:56.516 --> 00:11:58.894
No way!

00:12:00.479 --> 00:12:02.230
Galina is the winner!

00:12:02.230 --> 00:12:03.648
I won?!

00:12:03.648 --> 00:12:04.816
He won again!

00:12:04.816 --> 00:12:07.444
The plan is to take advantage
of his opponent’s power

00:12:07.444 --> 00:12:09.070
since he can’t win using his own power.

00:12:09.070 --> 00:12:10.655
That’s smart.

00:12:10.655 --> 00:12:13.450
You’re amazing, Gatchan!

00:12:13.450 --> 00:12:15.076
But…

00:12:16.119 --> 00:12:20.123
Takeshi is lifting Akebono
without much effort!

00:12:31.510 --> 00:12:32.719
I'm Takeshi.

00:12:32.719 --> 00:12:34.471
It looks like Galina has no chance.

00:12:34.471 --> 00:12:36.515
No matter how hard Gatchan tries…

00:12:36.515 --> 00:12:38.433
It can’t be helped.

00:12:38.433 --> 00:12:43.355
What I can do…
What I should do now is…

00:12:43.355 --> 00:12:46.775
…to come back from
this match without dying.

00:12:46.775 --> 00:12:49.110
Gatchan!

00:12:49.110 --> 00:12:50.028
Defeat him!

00:12:50.028 --> 00:12:52.739
--Don’t avoid him!
--I do sympathize with you, though!

00:12:52.739 --> 00:12:54.533
Gatchan!

00:12:54.533 --> 00:12:57.327
Just because it’s not them who’s fighting…

00:12:57.327 --> 00:12:59.204
Gatchan!

00:12:59.204 --> 00:13:01.331
I'm ready whenever you are!

00:13:01.331 --> 00:13:03.875
Of course you are.

00:13:03.875 --> 00:13:05.627
Muster up your courage!

00:13:05.627 --> 00:13:08.964
S-Say what you want!

00:13:08.964 --> 00:13:11.091
This is the semifinals!

00:13:12.092 --> 00:13:16.721
Takeshi… I know you’re
fighting for your mom.

00:13:16.721 --> 00:13:21.476
But it’s not just you…
I'm fighting for Alouette!

00:13:21.476 --> 00:13:23.687
Alouette!

00:13:23.687 --> 00:13:25.730
Mom!

00:13:25.730 --> 00:13:28.024
Alouette!

00:13:28.024 --> 00:13:31.403
Mom!

00:13:33.822 --> 00:13:34.823
Gatchan!

00:13:34.823 --> 00:13:36.825
He went head on!

00:13:38.743 --> 00:13:39.786
Ahh!

00:13:39.786 --> 00:13:41.705
--Gatchan got…
--…flattened!

00:13:41.705 --> 00:13:43.873
He was too weak.

00:13:47.127 --> 00:13:48.503
Sorry, guys.

00:13:48.503 --> 00:13:50.255
Good work, Gatchan.

00:13:50.255 --> 00:13:51.923
You fought well.

00:13:51.923 --> 00:13:53.758
I do sympathize with you.

00:13:53.758 --> 00:13:57.721
Now, let’s stay and see
Takeshi become the champion.

00:13:57.721 --> 00:13:59.431
What?!

00:13:59.431 --> 00:14:02.434
Tenth-ranked Yatter Maegashira!

00:14:03.476 --> 00:14:04.853
Hold on a sec!

00:14:04.853 --> 00:14:06.187
That’s a mecha!

00:14:06.187 --> 00:14:08.815
Objection! Objection!

00:14:08.815 --> 00:14:10.233
"Objection", you said?

00:14:10.233 --> 00:14:13.028
After careful deliberation,
your objection is denied!

00:14:13.028 --> 00:14:15.280
They didn’t even deliberate.

00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:17.907
In order to take Mom to a doctor…

00:14:17.907 --> 00:14:20.660
In order to let her eat nutritious food…

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:22.829
l definitely can’t lose!

00:14:22.829 --> 00:14:25.123
Start!

00:14:33.048 --> 00:14:36.259
The mecha is being pushed by a child like that?

00:14:42.557 --> 00:14:45.018
After careful deliberation,
the tenth-ranked Yatter Maegashira

00:14:45.018 --> 00:14:48.313
has been promoted to Yatter Komusubi!

00:14:48.313 --> 00:14:51.149
Even if it’s a Komusubi… or whatever it is…!

00:14:53.276 --> 00:14:56.029
Mom!

00:14:57.989 --> 00:14:59.741
Time to get crushed!

00:15:04.329 --> 00:15:07.874
Humans can’t defeat machines!

00:15:07.874 --> 00:15:09.834
Don’t step on the Yatter mecha!

00:15:17.550 --> 00:15:21.012
Yatter Komusubi is he winner!

00:15:21.012 --> 00:15:22.555
Tiger!

00:15:22.555 --> 00:15:26.893
Stop it! Let go of me!
Pro-wrestling is the strongest!

00:15:26.893 --> 00:15:29.270
Even if you break my joints…!

00:15:30.897 --> 00:15:34.025
The pro-wrestling champion is Yattertiger!

00:15:34.025 --> 00:15:36.027
Tiger!

00:15:41.199 --> 00:15:44.786
The boxing champion is Yatterkangaroo!

00:15:46.287 --> 00:15:48.665
We now conclude the tournament!

00:15:48.665 --> 00:15:50.041
What just happened?

00:15:50.041 --> 00:15:53.002
They weren’t gonna give out the sheep
or the pocket money from the start!

00:15:53.002 --> 00:15:57.173
That’s not the way… it should be!

00:15:57.173 --> 00:15:59.134
Galina, take Alouette somewhere safe!

00:15:59.134 --> 00:16:01.469
O-Okay.

00:16:01.469 --> 00:16:02.721
Let’s go.

00:16:03.346 --> 00:16:05.098
It’s unforgivable!

00:16:06.182 --> 00:16:09.561
If it’s unforgivable,
what’re you gonna do about it?

00:16:09.561 --> 00:16:11.604
Guys, we’re gonna give them hell!

00:16:12.814 --> 00:16:13.732
Yes…

00:16:13.732 --> 00:16:15.316
…ma'am!

00:16:17.402 --> 00:16:18.862
And, <i>click.</i>

00:16:30.874 --> 00:16:32.542
What’s going on?!

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:42.719
Gen… Gen… Genghiskhan!

00:16:42.719 --> 00:16:45.096
"Genghiskhan"?!

00:16:45.096 --> 00:16:47.557
What can it do with such a huge head?!

00:16:47.557 --> 00:16:48.933
Soap bubbles?!

00:16:54.439 --> 00:16:59.277
As long as Yatterman exists,
the fury of justice summons us!

00:16:59.277 --> 00:17:02.739
Doronbow is here!

00:17:02.739 --> 00:17:05.617
I go there and whisper.
I come here and whisper.

00:17:05.617 --> 00:17:07.452
This is Whispering Reporter.

00:17:07.452 --> 00:17:11.539
It seems that a fight break out.

00:17:11.539 --> 00:17:13.249
Are you recording this okay?

00:17:15.210 --> 00:17:16.336
Boyacky!

00:17:16.336 --> 00:17:17.921
Here goes!

00:17:20.381 --> 00:17:24.803
I'm a hurricane dog! Woof!
Give them a furious hurricane! Woof!

00:17:27.514 --> 00:17:29.432
Give them hell!

00:17:29.432 --> 00:17:32.227
Yes, ma’am!

00:17:32.268 --> 00:17:35.438
Genghiskhan!

00:17:35.438 --> 00:17:39.484
A mecha that calls itself Genghiskhan is
standing face to face with a Yatter mecha.

00:17:39.484 --> 00:17:42.487
By the way, legend has it that
Mongolian mutton barbeque

00:17:42.487 --> 00:17:44.572
is a dish that Genghis Khan had someone make.

00:17:44.572 --> 00:17:49.077
Everyone, stay away! I can handle
a puppet like that by myself!

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:57.585
Oh, my… it looks like it’s a do-or-die duel.

00:17:57.585 --> 00:18:00.839
Genghiskhan’s head is made of a steel
plate for cooking mutton barbeque!

00:18:00.839 --> 00:18:02.340
That must hurt!

00:18:02.340 --> 00:18:05.635
That damn hard head!
There’s still more coming?!

00:18:05.635 --> 00:18:09.097
Genghiskhan slams itself against its opponent.

00:18:09.097 --> 00:18:13.184
Yatter Komusubi… steps on its opponent.

00:18:13.184 --> 00:18:15.144
It’s now high in the air!

00:18:15.144 --> 00:18:16.104
After careful deliberation,

00:18:16.104 --> 00:18:19.357
Yatter Komusubi receives an
accelerated promotion and is now…

00:18:19.357 --> 00:18:20.316
Accelerated promotion?!

00:18:20.316 --> 00:18:22.527
Don’t tell me it’s now Yatter Yokoz…

00:18:27.866 --> 00:18:30.201
…a Yatter Oyakata!

00:18:30.201 --> 00:18:33.663
It’s retired from being a sumo wrestler!

00:18:33.663 --> 00:18:37.750
Don’t worry abou the details!

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:40.128
Lamb Chop!

00:18:40.128 --> 00:18:41.796
Its reaction’s gotten slower?

00:18:41.796 --> 00:18:45.383
It’s slapping… slapping…
and slapping even more.

00:18:47.302 --> 00:18:50.138
Yatter Oyakata has been pushed outside!

00:18:50.138 --> 00:18:53.224
And it exploded.

00:18:53.224 --> 00:18:55.977
Looks like the game is over.

00:18:55.977 --> 00:18:57.896
Kangaroo!

00:19:00.106 --> 00:19:01.733
A surprise attack!

00:19:01.733 --> 00:19:04.569
It wasn’t just one opponent
that you were up against!

00:19:04.569 --> 00:19:07.238
Genghiskhan is in a fix!

00:19:08.239 --> 00:19:10.783
At this time, they bring out their
secret weapon, a machine gun!

00:19:10.783 --> 00:19:14.245
A toy like that doesn’t work on me!

00:19:14.245 --> 00:19:16.956
From inside of Yatterkangaroo… here comes…

00:19:16.956 --> 00:19:19.208
…a child kangaroo!

00:19:19.208 --> 00:19:21.210
He’s so cute!

00:19:24.172 --> 00:19:25.965
Those are tremendous beams!

00:19:25.965 --> 00:19:27.634
Watch it! You’ll hit one of our own!

00:19:27.634 --> 00:19:30.386
The child kangaroo’s
stronger than it appears?!

00:19:30.386 --> 00:19:32.764
I’ll heat the steel plate.

00:19:32.764 --> 00:19:35.892
--Heating up!
--Genghiskhan has become hot!

00:19:35.892 --> 00:19:38.686
Yatterkangaroo! Whoa!

00:19:41.689 --> 00:19:44.609
It’s a head-on power fight!

00:19:44.609 --> 00:19:47.737
-Mongolian Missile!
--Genghiskhan shot a missile!

00:19:49.155 --> 00:19:51.074
You damn Genghiskhan!

00:19:51.074 --> 00:19:53.952
Yatterkangaroo exploded, too!

00:19:53.952 --> 00:19:54.953
Tiger!

00:19:54.953 --> 00:19:57.705
And, here comes Yattertiger!

00:19:57.705 --> 00:20:03.461
Genghiskhan is using its legs
as if they were a tiger’s jaws…

00:20:03.461 --> 00:20:04.420
Tiger Shot!

00:20:04.420 --> 00:20:07.048
…and crunched its opponent splendidly!

00:20:07.966 --> 00:20:10.259
Lord Yatterman…!

00:20:10.259 --> 00:20:13.137
That was an amazing leg
technique by Genghiskhan!

00:20:13.137 --> 00:20:17.517
With its mask removed,
Yattertiger has now become Yattercat!

00:20:19.143 --> 00:20:24.273
And, sadly, Yattercat… explodes!

00:20:28.653 --> 00:20:34.409
Now that the incredible fighter Genghiskhan
has won all three tournaments,

00:20:34.409 --> 00:20:36.828
the champion belts, three sheep,

00:20:36.828 --> 00:20:40.999
and, surprisingly, pocket money
are awarded to them!

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:48.172
The tournament report was brought
to you by Whispering Reporter.

00:20:50.258 --> 00:20:54.470
Yatter! Yatter! Yatter! Yatter!

00:20:54.470 --> 00:21:02.645
--They sure are tough.
--Yatter! Yatter! Yatter! Yatter!

00:21:02.687 --> 00:21:07.191
Yatter! Yatter! Yatter! Yatter!

00:21:14.365 --> 00:21:19.203
Sheep… and this is… pocket money?
How did this happen?

00:21:23.458 --> 00:21:28.379
I don’t know what’s going on,
but now I can help Mom!

00:21:31.379 --> 00:21:34.802
Mom!

00:21:34.802 --> 00:21:37.305
Was it really okay, Miss Doronjo?

00:21:37.305 --> 00:21:40.892
Shouldn’t we have kept at least one sheep?

00:21:40.892 --> 00:21:43.352
That was fine. Right, Gatchan?

00:21:43.352 --> 00:21:45.730
What? Yeah… that’s right!

00:21:45.730 --> 00:21:48.524
But more importantly,
right now, we need to…

00:21:49.734 --> 00:21:52.070
…do something about this situation!

00:21:52.070 --> 00:21:55.823
Hold it! You rebels who call
themselves Doronjo and her gang!

00:21:55.823 --> 00:21:57.784
I’ll execute you this time for sure!

00:21:57.784 --> 00:22:01.245
Who’d wait just because they’re told to?!

00:22:06.584 --> 00:22:10.088
Damn Yatterman!

00:22:10.900 --> 00:22:17.990
Should I raise my RPM and dream?

00:22:20.200 --> 00:22:25.620
Don't put it off for tomorrow, do it now

00:22:25.620 --> 00:22:27.920
My strong heart wants to get started

00:22:27.920 --> 00:22:30.000
I want to see change, so let's go

00:22:29.880 --> 00:22:35.550
I'm running too fast to smell the roses

00:22:35.340 --> 00:22:37.590
My strong heart's at max speed

00:22:37.590 --> 00:22:40.180
I made a wish because I wanted a change

00:22:40.180 --> 00:22:44.140
I search, I tire, I fall, and I get back up

00:22:44.140 --> 00:22:50.770
I'll enjoy this every time

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:53.440
Continue your passion

00:22:53.440 --> 00:22:55.900
Continue your passion

00:22:55.900 --> 00:22:57.190
I'll support you

00:22:57.190 --> 00:22:58.150
I'm on your side

00:22:58.150 --> 00:22:59.410
Jump, jump, pushing the limits is my life story

00:22:59.410 --> 00:23:01.200
Jump, jump, pushing the limits is my life story

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:05.660
My drive ain't no work of fiction

00:23:05.660 --> 00:23:06.870
I want to see you

00:23:06.870 --> 00:23:07.910
Today, if I can

00:23:07.910 --> 00:23:09.670
After all, my fingers just won't stop

00:23:09.670 --> 00:23:11.040
After all, my fingers just won't stop

00:23:11.040 --> 00:23:15.130
Don't you know?

00:23:12.880 --> 00:23:16.460
Day and night, I'm missing you

00:23:16.090 --> 00:23:17.800
The world might get you down,

00:23:17.630 --> 00:23:17.800
Nothing in the world is going your way

00:23:17.800 --> 00:23:19.720
The world might get you down,

00:23:17.800 --> 00:23:20.180
Nothing in the world is going your way

00:23:20.180 --> 00:23:22.930
But continue your passions

00:23:22.930 --> 00:23:26.100
But continue your passions

00:23:29.810 --> 00:23:37.900
Keep praying and dreaming
